---
title: Login flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web server
    participant DB
    box Aqua Backend services
        participant Auth
    end
    U->>+W: Open login page
    W-->>-U: Login form
    loop Every attempt
        U->>W: Submit credentials
        W->>Auth: Verify
        alt valid
            Auth-->>W: Token
        else invalid
            Auth--xW: Rejected
        end
    end
    Note over U,W: Session starts
    W-)DB: Log event
    rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
        DB->>DB: Rotate logs
    end
    activate W
    deactivate W
    this line is garbage
